# Godot conventions

- **Engine:** Godot 4.7, Forward Plus. Prefer 2D node/APIs consistent with the existing hammer demo unless a doc in `docs/tech/` says otherwise.
- Match existing project layout: `entities/`, `systems/`, `levels/`, `resources/`.
- Prefer clear GDScript that matches nearby files (naming, signals, composition via child nodes/components).
- Do not add multiplayer / high-level multiplayer APIs.
- Record non-obvious engine or physics decisions in `docs/tech/` (ADR or short note), not only in code comments.
- Avoid drive-by refactors of unrelated scenes/scripts.
